### Health Display
- Health bar visualization:
  - Smooth transitions on updates (60fps)
  - Color indicators: 
    - Green: >75% health
    - Yellow: 25-75% health
    - Red: <25% health
  - Damage numbers: 
    - Popup on hit
    - Fade out over 1s
    - Show actual damage after defense
  - Total health display (base_health * quantity)
  - Update final values on global timer

