### Type & Mark Display
- Type indicators (top-left):
  - Dark background (rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7))
  - White text, 8pt, bold, rounded
  - Letters: B/G/P (Breacher/Guardian/Phreak)
  - Outside breacher rotation
- Mark indicators (top-right):
  - Format: "Mk{1-4}"
  - Match type indicator style
  - Always visible

### Status Visualization
- Target indication:
  - Proximity-based ONLY
  - Clear line to current target
  - Update on position change
- Range circle:
  - Match @DigitalBarracksScreen.tsx stats
  - Update real-time during movement
  - Show valid attack area
- Health status:
  - Total health calculation
  - Color-coded indicators
  - Update on global timer

